0\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Icy_Regurgitation\" title=\"Icy Regurgitation\">Icy Regurgitation</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rotting_Regurgitation\" title=\"Rotting Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rotting Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rotting_Regurgitation\" title=\"Rotting Regurgitation\">Rotting Regurgitation</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Venomous_Regurgitation\" title=\"Venomous Regurgitation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Generic_Poison_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Poison_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Generic_Poison_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Poison_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Generic_Poison_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Poison_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Venomous Regurgitation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Generic_Poison_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Poison_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Generic_Poison_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Venomous_Regurgitation\" title=\"Venomous Regurgitation\">Venomous Regurgitation</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>TWN_DISTILLERY_DRUNK_STATUS</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Blacked_Out\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blacked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Blacked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blacked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blacked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Blacked Out (Condition)\">Blacked Out</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Thisobald has overindulged in his own brew. He has a -5 penalty to <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and is <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to Slashing, Piercing, Bludgeoning and Thunder Damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Moderately_Inebriated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moderately_Inebriated_(Condition)\" title=\"Moderately Inebriated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moderately Inebriated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Moderately Inebriated</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Each sip of his special brew makes Thisobald more intoxicated.</li>\n<li>He has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Charisma and Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>, and has started hallucinating imps.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Profoundly_Intoxicated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Profoundly_Intoxicated_(Condition)\" title=\"Profoundly Intoxicated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Profoundly Intoxicated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Profoundly_Intoxicated_(Condition)\" title=\"Profoundly Intoxicated (Condition)\">Profoundly Intoxicated</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Thisobald is on the verge of passing out from his heavy drinking.</li>\n<li>He has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Charisma and Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>, and his hallucinations continue.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202022\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3895/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 67403/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17698/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.043/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1277219/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   72.397      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   72.397      1 -total\n 56.76%   41.092      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 35.12%   25.423      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 32.03%   23.192     14 Template:Icon_link\n 30.55%   22.114     14 Template:Icon_text\n 25.02%   18.113     37 Template:Trim\n 22.84%   16.536      6 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 21.40%   15.491      6 Template:MdSAI\n 10.61%    7.679      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31339-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202022 and revision id 342723. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>